      "en": "1) Look for an **official API** or an export file first — easier, more stable and allowed. 2) Read the **terms of use** and robots.txt and follow them. 3) Do not collect personal data or republish copyrighted content. 4) **Go slowly**: one request every second or two, and identify yourself with a User-Agent that includes a contact. 5) Store what you fetched instead of requesting the same page again and again. Practise on sites made for it, such as books.toscrape.com."
