     "p": {
      "ar": "المراقب بيشتغل لوحده (كل 6 ساعات مثلًا) بـ cron أو Task Scheduler (أسبوع 20) أو Schedule Trigger في n8n بينادي السكربت. لما يلاقي تغيير مهم يبعت Telegram أو يبعت JSON لـ n8n Webhook (أسبوع 13) اللي يوزّعه. ومتبعتش تنبيه لو مفيش جديد — التنبيهات الكتير بتتجاهل.",
      "en": "The watcher runs by itself (every 6 hours, say) via cron or Task Scheduler (week 20) or an n8n Schedule Trigger calling the script. When it finds an important change it sends Telegram or posts JSON to an n8n Webhook (week 13) to spread it. Send nothing when nothing changed — too many alerts get ignored."
     },
     "ex": "def build_message(added, removed, changed, titles):\n    lines = []\n    for key, before, after in changed:\n        arrow = \"📉\" if after < before else \"📈\"\n        lines.append(f\"{arrow} {titles.get(key, key)}: {before:.2f} → {after:.2f}\")\n    if added:\n        lines.append(f\"🆕 {len(added)} new: \" + \", \".join(titles.get(k, k) for k in added[:5]))\n    if removed:\n        lines.append(f\"❌ {len(removed)} removed\")\n    return \"\\n\".join(lines)   # empty string = nothing to send\n\nmsg = build_message([\"/b4\"], [], [(\"/b1\", 50.0, 42.5)], {\"/b1\": \"Sharp Objects\", \"/b4\": \"Soumission\"})\nprint(msg or \"(no alert)\")",
     "run": 1
