     "p": "import json\nfrom datetime import datetime\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nSNAPS = Path(\"snapshots\"); SNAPS.mkdir(exist_ok=True)\n\ndef save_snapshot(items: dict) -> Path:\n    path = SNAPS / f\"{datetime.now():%Y-%m-%d_%H%M}.json\"\n    path.write_text(json.dumps(items, ensure_ascii=False, indent=1), encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    return path\n\ndef last_snapshot() -> dict:\n    files = sorted(SNAPS.glob(\"*.json\"))\n    return json.loads(files[-1].read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")) if files else {}\n\nprint(last_snapshot())\nsave_snapshot({\"/b1\": {\"price\": 42.5}})\nprint(last_snapshot())",
